IMPORT types

§ `Part I - Preliminary`

§§ `1. Short title`

`the short title of this Act` MEANS "Residential Tenancies Act 1987"

§§ `3. Terms used`

-- s.3: residential premises means premises that constitute or are
-- intended to constitute a place of residence.
-- s.5(5): a caravan-park site is treated as residential premises.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the premises are residential premises` IF
        arrangement's `the premises constitute or are intended to constitute a place of residence`
    OR  arrangement's `the premises are a site at a caravan park`

-- s.3: residential tenancy agreement means any agreement, whether or
-- not in writing and whether express or implied, under which any person
-- for valuable consideration grants to any other person a right to occupy,
-- whether exclusively or otherwise, any residential premises, or part of
-- residential premises, for the purpose of residence.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the arrangement is a residential tenancy agreement` IF
        arrangement's `any person for valuable consideration grants to any other person a right to occupy premises`
    AND arrangement's `the right to occupy is for the purpose of residence`
    AND `the premises are residential premises` arrangement

§§ `4. Position of Crown`

-- s.4: Subject to sections 5(2)(f) and 6, this Act binds the Crown.
-- Those qualifications are applied in the s.5(2)(f) and s.6 tests below.

`this Act binds the Crown` MEANS TRUE

§§ `5. Application of Act`

-- s.5(4): a fixed term of 3 months or longer is deemed, in the absence
-- of proof to the contrary, not to have been entered into bona fide
-- for a holiday.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the holiday purpose is deemed not bona fide` IF
        arrangement's `the agreement is for a fixed term of 3 months or longer`
    AND NOT arrangement's `there is proof that the holiday purpose is bona fide`

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement is bona fide entered into for the purpose of conferring on a person a right to occupy premises for a holiday` IF
        arrangement's `the stated purpose is to confer a right to occupy premises for a holiday`
    AND NOT `the holiday purpose is deemed not bona fide` arrangement

-- s.5(1A): this Act does not apply to a strata lease. The note says
-- that does not affect a residential tenancy agreement that is a
-- sublease of a strata lease.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 5(1A) strata lease exclusion applies` IF
        arrangement's `the agreement is a strata lease`
    AND NOT arrangement's `the agreement is a sublease of a strata lease`

-- s.5(2)(c) company-title scheme.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement arises under a company title scheme` IF
        arrangement's `a group of adjacent premises is owned by a company`
    AND arrangement's `the premises comprising the group are let by the company to persons who jointly have a controlling interest in the company`

-- s.5(2)(a): sale-and-purchase, unless the tenancy period is one month or longer.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 5(2)(a) sale and purchase exclusion applies` IF
        arrangement's `the tenant is a party to an agreement for the sale and purchase of the premises`
    AND NOT arrangement's `the period of the tenancy is one month or longer`

-- s.5(2): this Act does not apply in any of the following circumstances.
-- Conjunction order matches the statute: (a) to (g).

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a section 5(2) circumstance applies` IF
        `section 5(2)(a) sale and purchase exclusion applies` arrangement
    OR  arrangement's `the agreement arises under a mortgage in respect of the premises`
    OR  `the agreement arises under a company title scheme` arrangement
    OR  arrangement's `the tenant is a boarder or lodger`
    OR  `the agreement is bona fide entered into for the purpose of conferring on a person a right to occupy premises for a holiday` arrangement
    OR  arrangement's `the agreement is entered into as lessor by a prescribed person or agency acting on behalf of the Crown`
    OR  arrangement's `the agreement is a prescribed agreement or of a prescribed class`

-- s.5(3)(b): student accommodation, unless prescribed.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 5(3)(b) student accommodation exclusion applies` IF
        NOT arrangement's `the student accommodation is prescribed for the purposes of section 5(3)(b)`
    AND (
            arrangement's `the premises are student accommodation provided by an educational institution`
        OR  (
                arrangement's `the premises are student accommodation provided by an entity other than the educational institution`
            AND arrangement's `the student accommodation is provided other than for the purpose of making a profit`
            )
        )

-- s.5(3): this Act does not apply to or in relation to any of the following.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a section 5(3) circumstance applies` IF
        arrangement's `the premises are any part of a hotel or motel`
    OR  `section 5(3)(b) student accommodation exclusion applies` arrangement
    OR  arrangement's `the premises are any part of a hospital or nursing home`
    OR  arrangement's `the premises are used for the purposes of a club`
    OR  arrangement's `the premises are used to provide residential care by an approved provider`
    OR  arrangement's `the premises are prescribed premises or of a prescribed class`

-- s.5(6): residential-park sites are out, other than an existing written
-- fixed-term long-stay agreement to which the 2006 Act does not apply.

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 5(6) residential park exclusion applies` IF
        arrangement's `the premises are a site at a residential park`
    AND NOT (
            arrangement's `a person has a right to occupy the site`
        AND arrangement's `the agreement is an existing fixed term long-stay agreement made in writing to which the Residential Parks (Long-stay Tenants) Act 2006 does not apply`
            )

-- s.5(1): subject to this section and sections 6 and 7, this Act applies
-- to any residential tenancy agreement entered into, renewed, extended,
-- assigned or otherwise transferred after the commencement of this Act.

@ref Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) s.5
@export Decide whether the Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) applies to an occupancy arrangement
GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement` @desc Occupancy facts for s.3 and s.5: whether valuable consideration grants a right to occupy for residence; whether the premises are residential, a caravan-park site or a residential-park site; strata lease / sublease; post-commencement dealing; sale-and-purchase; mortgage; company title; boarder or lodger; holiday purpose and 3-month deeming; Crown / prescribed agreement; hotel, motel, student accommodation, hospital, nursing home, club, aged care, prescribed premises; and any s.6 regulation switching the Act off.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this Act applies to the arrangement` IF
        `the arrangement is a residential tenancy agreement` arrangement
    AND arrangement's `the agreement was entered into, renewed, extended, assigned or otherwise transferred after the commencement of this Act`
    AND NOT `section 5(1A) strata lease exclusion applies` arrangement
    AND NOT `a section 5(2) circumstance applies` arrangement
    AND NOT `a section 5(3) circumstance applies` arrangement
    AND NOT `section 5(6) residential park exclusion applies` arrangement
    AND NOT arrangement's `a regulation provides that this Act shall not apply`

GIVEN arrangement IS A `occupancy arrangement`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `why this Act does not apply` IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the arrangement is a residential tenancy agreement` arrangement
            THEN "not a residential tenancy agreement (s.3)"
        IF NOT arrangement's `the agreement was entered into, renewed, extended, assigned or otherwise transferred after the commencement of this Act`
            THEN "not entered into, renewed, extended, assigned or transferred after commencement (s.5(1))"
        IF `section 5(1A) strata lease exclusion applies` arrangement
            THEN "strata lease (s.5(1A))"
        IF `a section 5(2) circumstance applies` arrangement
            THEN "a section 5(2) circumstance applies"
        IF `a section 5(3) circumstance applies` arrangement
            THEN "a section 5(3) circumstance applies"
        IF `section 5(6) residential park exclusion applies` arrangement
            THEN "residential park site (s.5(6))"
        IF arrangement's `a regulation provides that this Act shall not apply`
            THEN "regulation modifies application (s.6)"
        OTHERWISE "this Act applies"

§§ `Fixtures`

`ordinary private rental` MEANS `occupancy arrangement` WITH
    `any person for valuable consideration grants to any other person a right to occupy premises` IS TRUE,
    `the right to occupy is for the purpose of residence` IS TRUE,
    `the premises constitute or are intended to constitute a place of residence` IS TRUE,
    `the premises are a site at a caravan park` IS FALSE,
    `the premises are a site at a residential park` IS FALSE,
    `a person has a right to occupy the site` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is an existing fixed term long-stay agreement made in writing to which the Residential Parks (Long-stay Tenants) Act 2006 does not apply` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is a strata lease` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is a sublease of a strata lease` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement was entered into, renewed, extended, assigned or otherwise transferred after the commencement of this Act` IS TRUE,
    `the tenant is a party to an agreement for the sale and purchase of the premises` IS FALSE,
    `the period of the tenancy is one month or longer` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement arises under a mortgage in respect of the premises` IS FALSE,
    `a group of adjacent premises is owned by a company` IS FALSE,
    `the premises comprising the group are let by the company to persons who jointly have a controlling interest in the company` IS FALSE,
    `the tenant is a boarder or lodger` IS FALSE,
    `the stated purpose is to confer a right to occupy premises for a holiday` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is for a fixed term of 3 months or longer` IS FALSE,
    `there is proof that the holiday purpose is bona fide` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is entered into as lessor by a prescribed person or agency acting on behalf of the Crown` IS FALSE,
    `the agreement is a prescribed agreement or of a prescribed class` IS FALSE,
